{"seq":28,"slug":"mobile-architecture-patterns","title":"移动端架构模式","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.37,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 移动端架构模式\n\n移动应用的架构选型决定了代码的可测试性、可维护性与团队协作效率。当应用从单人原型成长为多团队协作的百万行级产品时，架构不再是\"选哪个模式\"的一次性决策，而是贯穿生命周期的持续演进过程。本 hub 聚焦 iOS 与 Android 共通的架构原理和模式——它们以不同语法落地到 Swift/SwiftUI 或 Kotlin/Compose，但背后的状态流转、依赖管理、模块边界等设计思想高度一致。\n\n本 hub 与相邻 hub 的分工边界如下：纯 iOS 特有的 VIPER、Coordinator、SwiftUI App Lifecycle 等模式归属 ios-architecture；纯 Android 特有的 Activity/Fragment 生命周期管理、Jetpack ViewModel 细节归属 android-development；Flutter/RN/KMP 等框架级跨平台方案归属 cross-platform-development。本 hub 提取的是跨越两大平台的共性架构思维——MVC/MVP/MVVM 的演进脉络、Clean Architecture 的分层策略、单向数据流的状态机模型、可组合架构的代数方法、模块化与依赖注入的工程实践，以及架构决策的文档化方法。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从第一章「架构基础」建立 MVC → MVVM → 单向数据流的演进认知，再进入第二章「现代模式」了解 TCA、MVI、模块化等 2024-2026 年工业界主流方案，第三章「横切关注点」解决依赖注入、导航路由、状态管理这三个架构落地时绑定最紧的基础设施问题，最后第四章「工程实践」讨论测试策略、遗留迁移与决策记录，将架构选型接入团队日常工程纪律。\n\n前置知识：至少一门移动端语言（Swift 或 Kotlin）的中级使用经验；对面向对象设计原则（SOLID）有基本了解；有过至少一个完整移动应用的开发经历。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"架构基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mvc-mvp-mvvm","title":"MVC、MVP 与 MVVM 的演进","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/mvc-mvp-mvvm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture-mobile","title":"Clean Architecture 移动端实践","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/clean-architecture-mobile"},{"seq":3,"slug":"unidirectional-data-flow","title":"单向数据流架构","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/unidirectional-data-flow"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-patterns","title":"现代模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"composable-architecture","title":"可组合架构（TCA / Composable Architecture）","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/composable-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mvi-redux-mobile","title":"MVI 与 Redux 移动端实现","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/mvi-redux-mobile"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modularization-strategies","title":"模块化策略","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/modularization-strategies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-cutting","title":"横切关注点","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-injection-mobile","title":"移动端依赖注入","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/dependency-injection-mobile"},{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-routing-patterns","title":"导航与路由模式","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/navigation-routing-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-management-mobile","title":"移动端状态管理","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/state-management-mobile"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-testing-strategies","title":"架构测试策略","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-testing-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"legacy-migration-patterns","title":"遗留代码迁移模式","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/legacy-migration-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"architecture-decision-mobile","title":"架构决策与文档化","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-decision-mobile"}]}]}